/T (1\) Digital Twin is more than simple, using AI/ML or GenAI 2\) Domain Expertise Matter most packages available are modeled around mathematics-based. However, in order to be effective you need a physics-based model 3\) Digital Twin gives real-time closed loop solution so its much more than just an analytical tool 4\) Training is very crucial 5\) We need to move this tech from educational institutes into the hands of practicing engineers)
/E (1\) Digital Twin is more than simple, using AI/ML or GenAI 2\) Domain Expertise Matter most packages available are modeled around mathematics-based. However, in order to be effective you need a physics-based model 3\) Digital Twin gives real-time closed loop solution so its much more than just an analytical tool 4\) Training is very crucial 5\) We need to move this tech from educational institutes into the hands of practicing engineers)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [4]
